OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mix of     
OL,6,Fclear spells and cloudy periods this   
OL,7,Fevening, but remaining dry overnight.  
OL,8,FLight winds inland, but noticeably     
OL,9,Fstronger along the coast. Becoming     
OL,10,Fcold through the night, with a frost   
OL,11,Fpossible by dawn over higher ground.   
OL,13,CThursday:FStaying dry, with some sunny 
OL,14,Fspells throughout Thursday. Becoming   
OL,15,Fbreezy by the afternoon, especially    
OL,16,Falong the coast. Cold and frosty       
OL,17,Fovernight.                             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
