OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy   
OL,6,Fon Friday, with rain moving in by mid- 
OL,7,Fday. Unsettled on Saturday, with       
OL,8,Foutbreaks of heavy rain. Brighter and  
OL,9,Fsunnier on Sunday. Temperatures        
OL,10,Frecovering to around normal by the     
OL,11,Fweekend.                               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
